            <div type="apparatus">
                <listApp>
                    <app><note>Text from EDR; comparison with photograph, and with restoration of Fishwick 1991, 612</note></app>
                    <app loc="1"><note>EDR indicates line 1 has been erased, but this is not evident on the stone</note></app>
                    <app loc="4"><note>EDR restores c(reatus) d(ecreto) d(ecurionum) in line 3.</note></app>
                </listApp>
