            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>To the shades of the underworld, for Audasiae Cales, daughter of Quintus. Quintus Audasius Acmazon, sexvir Augustalis, worshipper of the divine house(?), in Mediolanum and in Forum Popilii, the father. She lived for 5 years, 4 months and 3 days.</p>
            </div>
